window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Everything has led to this. Sabrina is trapped in Viktor’s world, standing at the edge of an impossible choice. Her mission demands his death, but her heart is tangled in the twisted love they’ve built.</p> <p>Every moment with him blurs the line between who she was and who she’s become. Will she finish what she started and destroy him—or sacrifice everything for a love that could consume her?</p> <p><b>All books in the series need to be listened to in order.</b></p>"; 
